source: tests/help_pages.rs
description: "a command's -h and --help pages as this build renders them at 100 columns without color; any change to an about, a flag, a value, a heading or the layout changes them: review with cargo insta review, or re-accept with INSTA_UPDATE=always cargo test --test integration help_pages:: and review git diff tests/snapshots/"
---
==> omaddons adopt -h <==
Bring addons installed by hand under management

Usage: omaddons adopt [OPTIONS] [FOLDER]...

Arguments:
  [FOLDER]...  Adopt the addons these folders belong to

Options:
      --apply      Adopt every exact and identified addon (never a guess)
      --ref <REF>  Where the one folder named comes from: anything install accepts
      --no-verify  Identify only: download nothing, compare nothing
      --refresh    Ask every source now, even when it was checked in the last 15 minutes

Examples:
  omaddons adopt                    where each unmanaged folder comes from
  omaddons adopt --apply -t retail  adopt what is identified, as it is
  omaddons adopt Bagnon --ref wowi:25068 -t retail
                                    say where a folder comes from

Global: -t <TARGET>  --json  --dry-run  -v  --quiet  --no-color  --offline  (--help lists them all)
==> omaddons adopt --help <==
Bring addons installed by hand under management

Folders installed by hand or by another manager are recorded as they are: only records change, never
a folder, and it is undoable. Alone, adopt reports where each unmanaged folder comes from and
changes nothing.

Usage: omaddons adopt [OPTIONS] [FOLDER]...

Arguments:
  [FOLDER]...
          Adopt the addons these folders belong to
          
          A guess is adopted too, unless it has rivals.

Options:
      --apply
          Adopt every exact and identified addon (never a guess)

      --ref <REF>
          Where the one folder named comes from: anything install accepts
          
          On a folder already managed, it re-points its addon to this ref instead.

      --no-verify
          Identify only: download nothing, compare nothing

      --refresh
          Ask every source now, even when it was checked in the last 15 minutes

Examples:
  omaddons adopt                                  where each unmanaged folder comes from
  omaddons adopt --apply -t retail                adopt what is identified, folders unchanged
  omaddons adopt MyFoo --ref gh:o/foo -t retail   say which ref a folder is

See also: list, install

Global options:
      --json              One JSON envelope on stdout
      --format <FORMAT>   Output format [possible values: json, human]
  -t, --target <TARGET>   The client to act on: id, game mode, family, path, or all [alias:
                          --flavor]
      --dry-run           Show the plan without changing anything
      --actor <ACTOR>     Who is acting: human, agent or widget [env: OMADDONS_ACTOR]
      --reason <TEXT>     Why, recorded verbatim in history
      --offline           Fail any network access [env: OMADDONS_OFFLINE=1]
      --while-running     Allow folder changes while the client runs (never SavedVariables)
      --if-match <TOKEN>  Run only what the preview that returned this token showed
      --no-color          No ANSI color
      --no-progress       No progress output
      --progress <MODE>   Progress events on stderr [possible values: json, human, none]
      --quiet             Only errors on stderr
  -v, --verbose...        More detail (repeatable)
  -h, --help              Show help

Learn more: omaddons robot-docs guide
